[PrintTextModified Text:跟随在了看守和亚里沙的身后。|#0101Bad02_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:根据地图，可以得知过道的尽头是惩罚室。|#0101Bad02_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（说不定亚里沙她<br>　违反了某些规定）|#0101Bad02_Ema001|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（毕竟她说过要逃出这里……<br>　也许是因为策划逃跑才会被抓的）|#0101Bad02_Ema002|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（惩罚室……<br>　肯定会在里面遭受可怕的惩罚吧）|#0101Bad02_Ema003|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:说不定，会跟希罗一样——|#0101Bad02_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:回想起沾满血迹的会客厅，<br>艾玛浑身颤抖。|#0101Bad02_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（应该没事吧……<br>　亚里沙也没有很激烈地反抗）|#0101Bad02_Ema004|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:一定不会被杀的。|#0101Bad02_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛自言自语着，就好像在说给她自己听一样。|#0101Bad02_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

