[PrintTextModified Text:（这里就是惩罚室……）|#0101Bad02_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这里并排着几扇厚实的门，每扇门都用挂锁封闭着。<br>相比囚犯的房间，这里的空气显得更加沉重。|#0101Bad02_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:过道上除了艾玛之外，别无他人。<br>说不定亚里沙已经被关进<br>房间里面了。|#0101Bad02_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙……？|#0101Bad02_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛用颤抖的声音，轻轻呼喊亚里沙的名字。|#0101Bad02_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就算亚里沙人在里面某处，<br>只凭目前的音量，根本无法传达。|#0101Bad02_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:当然，此时不应该会有回应——|#0101Bad02_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HidePrinter
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:3_2 SubId:Middle

