[PrintTextModified Text:紧贴在艾玛眼前的这道惩罚室的门，<br>发出了巨大声响，自行打开了。|#0101Bad02_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛摆好了姿势，以为会有人从里面走出来。|#0101Bad02_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0101Bad02_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不过，等了好一会，<br>也不见有人出来。|#0101Bad02_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……？|#0101Bad02_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:感到异状的艾玛靠近了门，<br>战战兢兢地往室内看去。|#0101Bad02_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:！！|#0101Bad02_Ema011| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛用手捂住嘴巴，<br>好止住不自觉发出的喊声。|#0101Bad02_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyCamera Offset:0,0 Zoom:0 EasingTypeName:SmoothStep Duration:0.9 Lazy:false
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

[PrintTextModified Text:她看见惩罚室内那些充满邪恶气息的工具，不禁浑身颤抖，<br>往后退了一步。|#0101Bad02_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

