[PrintTextModified Text:背后有什么推了她一把，害艾玛跌倒在惩罚室内。<br>等她回头一看，发现房门正要关上。|#0101Bad02_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:等、等下！|#0101Bad02_Ema013| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 牢の施錠音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_4 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

