[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛慌忙爬起身来，<br>但惩罚室的厚重房门已在她眼前紧紧闭上了。|#0101Bad02_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:开门啊！为什么要把我关在里面！？|#0101Bad02_Ema014| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛大喊着，但没有得到任何回应。|#0101Bad02_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor SubId:Overlay

[PrintTextModified Text:“被关在室内”这一情况，<br>唤醒了艾玛脑海深处的痛苦记忆。|#0101Bad02_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在初中时期，她被人关在厕所的隔间，<br>或者是体育用品仓库里面——|#0101Bad02_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在厕所里，她被人从上方洒水或者丢垃圾。|#0101Bad02_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在体育仓库里，则是好几个小时无法外出。|#0101Bad02_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 少女たちのくすくす笑う声
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Ambi_11_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:充满恶意的嘲笑，<br>如今仍萦绕在艾玛的耳边，不见消散。|#0101Bad02_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:住手呀。|#0101Bad02_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:住手住手住手住手住手！|#0101Bad02_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

