[PrintTextModified Text:！！|#0101Bad02_Ema017| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她似乎听见了门的另一侧传来了脚步声。|#0101Bad02_Narrative031| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛使出全力站起身来，<br>用门支撑住身体，竖起耳朵仔细倾听。|#0101Bad02_Narrative032| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ボイス加工：ドア越しの声
[PrintTextModified Text:这里是怎么回事……<br>不觉得空气超级沉重吗？|#0101Bad02_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ボイス加工：ドア越しの声
[PrintTextModified Text:是吗？我倒是没什么特别感觉耶。|#0101Bad02_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:（汉娜，雪莉！）|#0101Bad02_Ema018| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在饱受绝望折磨的艾玛眼前，出现了一道希望之光。|#0101Bad02_Narrative033| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR3,ArmL7 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:救救我！求你们！放我出去！|#0101Bad02_Ema019| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在门上的小窗处，艾玛拼命喊道。|#0101Bad02_Narrative034| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜！雪莉！我在这里！|#0101Bad02_Ema020| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不知二人是不是听到了她的呼声，<br>她们来到了艾玛所在的房间前。<br>接着，雪莉往里面看了看。|#0101Bad02_Narrative035| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3,ArmL7 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉！太好了……！<br>不知道为什么，我被关进了这里面……|#0101Bad02_Ema021| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛感受到了异样，于是停下了话语。|#0101Bad02_Narrative036| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

